Detonation Listening Device

----------

A handy tool for tuning ignition timing is a Det Can - A detonation listening device.

When tuning our ECU's for ignition timing, a common problem is setting up the knock threshold so that it detects knock accurately. When the engine and/or calibration is significantly modified, the factory knock threshold may no longer be accurate for detecting knock. A Det Can allows you to actually hear the sounds of combustion. When knock is happening, it …";}}s:10:"persistent";a:5:{s:4:"date";a:2:{s:7:"created";i:1427222371;s:8:"modified";i:1427224064;}s:7:"creator";s:9:"Rob Lloyd";s:4:"user";s:8:"shelgame";s:11:"last_change";a:7:{s:4:"date";i:1427224064;s:2:"ip";s:15:"205.144.100.200";s:4:"type";s:1:"E";s:2:"id";s:13:"det_can_setup";s:4:"user";s:8:"shelgame";s:3:"sum";s:0:"";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";}s:11:"contributor";a:1:{s:8:"shelgame";s:9:"Rob Lloyd";}}}